        }
      }
    },
    "메모를 보관함에 담았어요" : {
      "comment" : "Toast after quick note saved to inbox",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saved to Inbox"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "메모장에 모아 둔 걸 통째로 붙여넣으면 알아서 한 줄씩 나눠 담아요. 사진에서 읽어 올 수도 있고, 비밀번호처럼 보이는 값은 잠긴 단축어로 들어갑니다. 단축어 목록의 + 안에 있어요." : {
      "comment" : "DYK body: bulk import",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paste a whole pile from your notes app and we split it into separate snippets for you. You can also read it off a photo, and anything that looks like a password comes in locked. Look under + in your snippet list."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tempel seluruh isi aplikasi catatan Anda dan kami pisahkan menjadi pintasan terpisah. Bisa juga dibaca dari foto, dan apa pun yang tampak seperti kata sandi akan terkunci. Ada di menu + pada daftar pintasan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
