    "치는 시간만 세던 걸 고쳤어요. 계좌번호처럼 다른 앱에서 찾아와야 했던 값은 찾는 시간까지 셉니다. 어떻게 셌는지도 적어 뒀어요." : {
      "comment" : "What's new 5.0 feature 2 detail",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We used to count only typing time. Now values you had to fetch from another app, like an account number, include the time spent finding them. We also show how we counted."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dulu kami hanya menghitung waktu mengetik. Kini nilai yang harus diambil dari aplikasi lain, seperti nomor rekening, juga menghitung waktu mencarinya. Kami juga menunjukkan cara menghitungnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
